  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  name: fast-dds\n  version: \"2.6.12\"\n  major_minor_version: ${{ (version | split('.'))[:2] | join('.') }}\n\npackage:\n  name: fast-dds\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  - url: https://github.com/eProsima/Fast-DDS/archive/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n    sha256: 53476bcee331f28fe83e8387122fb7f84ab39209c459bd2cc227c71e4bd21c9b\n    patches:\n      - 0001-include-cstdint.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - cmake <4\n    - ninja\n    - pkg-config\n  host:\n    - fast-cdr >=1.0.24,<2\n    # The 2.6 branch still uses Asio's deprecated io_service API.\n    - asio >=1.10.8,<1.31\n    - tinyxml2\n    - openssl\n    - foonathan-memory\n  run:\n    - python\n    - if: win\n      then: pywin32\n    - fast-cdr >=1.0.24,<2\n    - asio >=1.10.8,<1.31\n    - tinyxml2\n    - openssl\n    - foonathan-memory\n  run_exports:\n    - ${{ pin_subpackage(name, upper_bound='x.x') }}\n  run_constraints:\n    - python >=3.6\n    - fast-rtps ==99999999 fast_rtps_collides_with_fast_dds\n\ntests:\n  - package_contents:\n      lib:\n        - if: win\n          then: fastrtps-${{ major_minor_version }}\n          else: fastrtps\n      include:\n        - fastdds/dds/domain/DomainParticipantFactory.hpp\n        - fastdds/rtps/Endpoint.h\n        - fastrtps/transport/UDPTransportDescriptor.h\n\n  - script:\n      - fast-discovery-server --help\n      - if: win\n        then:\n          - call fastdds --help\n          - call ros-discovery --help\n        else:\n          - fastdds --help\n          - ros-discovery --help\n\n  - requirements:\n      run:\n        - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n        - cmake <4\n        - ninja\n    files:\n      recipe:\n        - cmake_test/\n    script:\n      - if: unix\n        then: cmake -S cmake_test -B consumer -G Ninja $CMAKE_ARGS\n        else: cmake -S cmake_test -B consumer -G Ninja %CMAKE_ARGS%\n      - cmake --build consumer\n      - ctest --test-dir consumer --output-on-failure\n\nabout:\n  license: Apache-2.0\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  summary: |\n    eProsima Fast DDS (formerly Fast-RTPS)\n\n\n  homepage: https://github.com/eProsima/Fast-RTPS\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - wolfv\n    - MiguelCompany\n    - rsanchez15\n",
